int n;cin>>n;bool ok=true;
    for(int i=1,p;i<=n;i++){cin>>p;if((p-1)/10!=(i-1)/10)ok=false;}
    cout<<(ok?"Yes":"No")<<'\n';
}
```

### 易错点

